    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AR-15 CASE case\n\nOne case per call, created at entry with the mandatory fields and the booking prerequisites of the CASE case data (2026-10-23): country, account, asset (CVR), VIN or FIN, plate, mileage, assigned dealer, status In Progress, type, topic, reason and the primary contact. Updated with the context before a handover, delegated to XCCC for a retailer callback, closed at the end. ScrubFreeText masks e-mail addresses, phone numbers, VINs and postcodes in the free-text fields (CAC rule: never personal data in free text). A standard REST API behind the mock.",
        "width": 768,
        "height": 288,
        "color": 6
      },
